                <pb facs="0698" n="616" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg616"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 704.9312/5.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the American Ambassador.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1911-05-27"><hi rendition="#italic">May 27,
                        1911</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>If the Mexican Government has no objections the consular agent at Torreón may be
                    instructed to extend his informal good offices in behalf of Mr. Woo Lam Po.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Knox.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
